# GMS states it twice -- ten points while Holy Symbol stands and ten more for
# good -- and this is the pair as one grant. Self only: GMS halves the standing
# half for a party member away from the caster, which needs a position nothing
# here has.
#
# Ships dead, as every resistance in the game does: nothing inflicts a status
# or an element. The stats page shows it so the player can see what the point
# bought.
name: "Holy Symbol - Preparation"
skill_order: 8
description:
  "Increases resistance to status ailments and all elements from using Holy "
  "Symbol."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP
hyper: true
required_level: 165
max_level: 1
base {
  status_resistance: 20
  elemental_resistance: 0.20
}
